From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 11:10:35 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] devices: import AsteroidOS smartwatch device catalog

This patch imports configurations for the AsteroidOS smartwatch catalog:

- Asus ZenWatch series: asus-anthias, asus-sparrow, asus-swift, and asus-wren.
- LG watch series: lg-bass, lg-dory, lg-lenok, lg-narwhal, and lg-nemo.
- Mobvoi TicWatch series: ticwatch-catfish, ticwatch-harmony, ticwatch-inharmony,
  ticwatch-mooneye, ticwatch-rubyfish, ticwatch-skipjack, and ticwatch-tunny.
- Motorola Moto 360 series: motorola-minnow and motorola-smelt.
- Other watches: casio-koi, oppo-beluga, polar-pike, samsung-rinato,
  samsung-sprat, and sony-tetra.

Signed-off-by: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
